WEBVTT

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.640
Let me tell you, Mr. He.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.280
Don't think just because you gave me the map,

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:44.640
you are safe now.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.060
Then what else do you want?

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.960
If that map can't be deciphered,

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.490
you won't have an easy time.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.780
You still dare to threaten me now?

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.280
I am all alone now.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:01:59.940
I'm not afraid of you anymore.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.760
All alone?

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:03.560
Really?

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:06.400
Chibe.

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:12.520
Ni'er.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:18.120
You...

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:26.680
What is going on here?

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:29.760
Do you really think you sent them away?

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.079
Speed up and catch up with them.

00:02:47.079 --> 00:02:48.079
Get ahead of them.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.000
Yes. Go.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.000
I clearly switched it

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.330
and successfully lured you in. How is this possible?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.120
As a Chinese saying goes,

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:10.080
the mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.280
Tomorrow, you two will act separately.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:13.880
Ikebe,

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.490
go to this place.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.640
Yes. Kiriyama,

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:22.360
you take a detour to this place.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:24.400
Ni'er. Brother.

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:27.360
Don't resist.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:30.040
Otherwise, both of them will die.

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:40.040
Mr. He,

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.329
don't play any more tricks.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:45.410
You've already run out of options.

00:03:46.079 --> 00:03:48.079
I gave you many chances to choose,

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.800
but you didn't cherish them.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.240
Now,

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.460
your wife, daughter, and Shangguan Ying

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.079
are all in my hands.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:02.200
Which one do you want me to kill first?

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:03.820
I didn't lie to you.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.810
But what exactly is going on with that map?

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.500
There are three maps in total.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:15.680
Huo Lang has the last one.

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:20.160
Only when these three maps are put together

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:21.930
will it be complete.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:26.400
Are you telling the truth this time?

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:27.800
Yes.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.840
I've told you everything.

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:35.520
Can you let them go now?

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.680
Go back and wait.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.490
When I find the third treasure map,

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.380
I will release them immediately.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:58.480
What?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.220
Didn't understand me,

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:03.520
or do you want them dead?

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.640
Old fox.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.520
He Xiaobian.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:42.880
If I hadn't followed those Japanese today,

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.720
I never would have thought

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:46.580
that you were colluding with them

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.610
and killed our eldest brother.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.360
He treated you like his own brother,

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.080
and you betrayed him.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.460
You are worse than a beast.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:01.160
Banjin, you can't kill me yet.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.300
After I rescue Yinger and Xiaoni,

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:07.160
you can do whatever you want with me.

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.520
Yinger? Xiaoni?

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.160
Didn't you send them away?

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:14.160
You're trying to trick me again.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:21.840
Banjin,

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:23.960
listen to me.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.720
I had no other choice either.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.960
Masao Tahara used Ni'er and her mother

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:29.960
to threaten me,

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:33.940
saying he'd kill them if I didn't cooperate.

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.780
I wanted to send them away.

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.680
I thought my plan was flawless,

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.400
but that old fox Tahara

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.600
still saw through it.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.200
He captured them

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:46.760
and now they are locked in

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.880
Masao Tahara's house in Qinglong Stronghold.

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:54.200
One wrong step led to another.

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:56.520
I regret it so much.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:01.040
Banjin,

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:03.240
I hate Masao Tahara more than you do.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.920
I want to tear him into pieces.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.680
I almost succeeded a few days ago,

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.300
but he still managed to escape in the end.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:15.920
You?

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.480
I figured out his hideout,

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.140
and sent this information

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.040
to Huo Lang with a flying dagger.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:24.720
Huo Lang led his men to wipe out his lair,

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.520
but Tahara escaped.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.160
That's why he came to Qinglong Stronghold.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:37.320
Banjin.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:39.620
You know martial arts.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.159
Go save Ying'er and Xiaoni.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.680
Once you rescue them,

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.280
I'll accept any punishment you give me.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.840
I will go save them myself.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.159
Listen to me.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:55.200
Wait until I rescue Ying'er and Xiaoni,

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.010
then I'll come back and settle the score with you.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.080
Major.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.640
If we let He Xiaobian know now

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:33.799
that his people are in Qinglong Stronghold,

00:08:33.799 --> 00:08:36.360
I'm worried he might take some action.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.700
After all, this is his territory.

00:08:39.039 --> 00:08:41.520
You've seen how cunning this man is.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.280
He always pushes his luck.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.720
If we don't make him clearly understand

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:47.080
his own situation,

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.040
he won't reveal the secret of the third map.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:53.960
It's a bit risky to do this.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:56.560
That's why I had Chibe

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.500
make some arrangements outside.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:00.840
If He Xiaobian comes,

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.560
he will do it secretly.

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:05.560
He wouldn't dare grab them openly.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:08.000
He still doesn't dare let the rest of the stronghold

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.600
know our true identities.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:12.520
Exactly.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.650
That's the exact mindset I'm exploiting.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:22.360
Major, sir.

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:23.890
Someone is approaching us.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.800
So fast? How many?

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:29.640
Just one.

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:30.440
What?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:36.560
We've been exposed.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:38.360
Get Professor Takeshita

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.600
and bring Shangguan Ying and the others here.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:40.440
Yes, sir.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.560
Hurry up. Behave yourself.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:48.520
Hurry up.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.560
Move faster.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:52.600
Bastard.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.240
Go.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.380
Chief Huo has been out for so long.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:03.050
He should be back by now.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.380
Chief Huo said he'd hunt some wild game for everyone

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:07.460
to have a good meal.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.160
With the round trip,

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.760
it's hard to tell when he'll be back.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.100
I think he just doesn't want to come back.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.640
Miss Cai, you are absolutely right.

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:20.330
My second brother, that's just his personality.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:22.040
He can't stay idle anywhere.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:22.840
Right now,

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:26.780
he might be scrounging drinks on some mountain top.

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:30.480
What bad things are you saying behind my back? Second Brother!

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.640
No, no.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:34.440
I'm exhausted.

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:38.890
Second Brother.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:41.640
Second Brother.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.360
Where's the game?

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:44.640
What game?

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.240
I ran over half of Shanzhou.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.740
My horse is exhausted.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:53.400
I haven't even seen a shadow of this Tahara Masao.

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:58.960
No, Chief Huo.

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.560
You went looking for Tahara Masao

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:01.690
without telling us.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.440
Do you know how dangerous that is?

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:05.170
What good would telling you do?

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.120
I'm willing to face the danger.

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:08.050
I'm telling you.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:12.080
I went out specifically to find Tahara Masao today.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.400
He's lucky he didn't run into me.

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.560
If he ran into me,

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:18.720
I'd tear him apart.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.460
You only brought a few men.

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.650
What if you encountered the enemy?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.640
What do you mean?

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.320
Boosting the Japanese's morale

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:28.600
and destroying mine?

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.760
Alright, stop talking.

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:35.240
Tahara Masao is definitely hiding.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:36.680
Even if he's hiding,

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.210
there should be some trace.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.560
The people we sent out

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.650
haven't brought back any news.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:44.760
Second Brother, how about I go scout again?

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.720
Go scout.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:49.360
I don't believe we can't find him.

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.680
Shitou, bring my horse.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:01.920
Be quiet.

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:06.440
Major.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:07.480
What's the situation?

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.720
Ikebe was killed.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:10.480
Bastard.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:12.480
He Xiaobian.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:15.200
I will make you pay with your life.

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:16.360
What should we do?

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:20.280
Let's go. To He Xiaobian's house.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:21.800
Go.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.440
Go.

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:29.920
He Xiaobian,

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.730
I didn't expect you to be so dishonest.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.120
You promised

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:36.140
you would cooperate with me well.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.280
But you have broken your promise time and again.

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:40.480
Today you sent someone to kill me again.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:42.410
How do you explain this?

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:48.440
I didn't.

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.760
Tahara Masao, you misunderstood. I...

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.080
I didn't.

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:54.680
My subordinate Ikebe

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:55.800
was killed by your men.

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:57.000
And you still deny it?

00:12:58.360 --> 00:12:59.280
I didn't do it.

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:00.480
I really didn't do it.

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:01.610
That was Liu Banjin.

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.880
He just tried to kill me too.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.240
Aren't you standing here perfectly fine

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.560
right in front of me?

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.040
How dare you lie to me!

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.640
These three women today

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:14.040
must all die here.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.480
I didn't lie to you!

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.080
I have already told you all the secrets

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:23.210
of the treasure map.

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:25.880
I have no reason to lie to you anymore.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:27.340
I really didn't lie to you.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.640
I have no patience left for your nonsense.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:31.360
Today I will make you understand

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:34.800
that you will pay for your cleverness.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:37.300
Of the three women,

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:39.440
one must die.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:41.560
You choose.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:45.120
Tahara Masao,

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:48.880
you can't go back on your word!

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.160
Every word I said is true.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.160
Don't kill them!

00:13:58.680 --> 00:13:59.240
I beg you.

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.440
Let them go.

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.920
I don't believe your words anymore.

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:08.280
Of these three women,

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.040
one must die today.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.280
You choose.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.000
No.

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.440
I won't choose.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.720
If you won't choose,

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:25.640
then I will.

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:33.440
You definitely can't bear to part with your wife.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:37.400
And you definitely can't bear to part with your daughter.

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:42.440
Then there is only Miss Shangguan.

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:46.760
Shangguan Ying, you will take the fall for He Xiaobian.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:53.680
Mother!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:16.600
Mother!

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.000
Mother!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.440
Meixiang!

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:36.640
This is what happens when you don't listen.

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:40.760
Take them all away!

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:56.440
Meixiang!

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:02.720
Meixiang!

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:10.840
Meixiang!

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.160
Meixiang!

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:17.200
Meixiang!

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:20.400
Meixiang!

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:24.840
Meixiang!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:06.680
Major, there is a detached courtyard on the slope.

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:08.210
It is far from other houses.

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:10.880
There are only two people inside. Should we...

00:17:13.319 --> 00:17:14.319
leave them alive?

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:15.240
Yes.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:22.920
Go to sleep. Okay.

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:25.880
Who is it?

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:27.859
Can't you recognize my voice?

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:41.200
Go.

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:43.720
Miss!

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:45.360
Get in.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:51.440
Mr. Tahara.

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:53.160
I am good at codebreaking,

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:54.720
not evading pursuit.

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:56.560
Not to mention coming for nothing,

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:58.480
I don't want to lose my life here.

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:09.440
Rest assured, Professor Takeshita.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:10.680
Since I invited you here,

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:12.920
I will do my best to ensure your safety.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:15.240
Now there is a clue to the treasure.

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:17.760
When I find the third treasure map,

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.720
we will be successful.

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:22.160
Are you sure this time?

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:25.040
It was exchanged for a life.

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:26.800
Besides,

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:31.760
I also have the two of them as bargaining chips.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.840
I believe he won't lie to me.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:35.480
Then as for the third map,

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:38.280
where do you plan to start, Mr. Tahara?

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:40.280
Don't worry, Professor Takeshita.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.000
I will naturally find a way.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.560
No.

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.880
If you want him to live,

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.970
answer my questions honestly.

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:03.880
Is there any other way out of Qinglong Stronghold?

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.520
There are, but they're all sealed.

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:08.280
You must have a way.

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:09.680
Take us down the mountain,

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:11.410
and I promise you two won't die.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.080
Okay, okay, okay.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:44.760
Meixiang.

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:47.720
My wife.

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:50.480
Darling.

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:55.360
With you gone,

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.320
what's the point of my living?

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:09.080
But don't worry.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.440
I will definitely keep my promise.

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.020
I will take good care of Ni'er.

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.880
I will do everything I should do.

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:27.480
Otherwise,

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:29.980
after I die,

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.530
how could I have the face to be buried with you?

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:37.560
Meixiang,

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:40.640
wait for me.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:06.120
Major, I only found this in the kitchen.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:20.840
Major, why do we have to do this?

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:22.800
Now that we have these two people in our hands,

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:25.330
He Xiaobian will do whatever we tell him to do.

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:29.960
Kiriyama, use your brain.

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:32.240
Don't just think about killing.

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:36.440
Even though I killed He Xiaobian's wife,

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:38.490
and his daughter is in my hands,

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.000
do you really think

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:42.380
he will obediently follow my orders?

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:44.760
This man is not that simple.

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:52.440
Besides, in Qinglong Stronghold now,

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:54.520
even though he is the boss,

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:56.320
all the swordsmen here

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:58.880
are still loyal to Shangguan Bao.

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.520
If they find out

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:03.020
that He Xiaobian has joined us Japanese,

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:06.840
we will be like rats in a trap.

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:11.840
But then, why do we still need Qinglong Stronghold

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:13.000
and these swordsmen?

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:13.960
What's the use?

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:19.120
I never expected these swordsmen

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:20.200
to work for us.

00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:24.440
As long as we ensure they don't cooperate with the KMT or the Communists.

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:25.700
Once we take Shanzhou,

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:27.440
I will deal with them.

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:30.720
I see.

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:32.520
Understood.

00:22:32.720 --> 00:22:34.360
The third map in Huo Lang's hands,

00:22:34.360 --> 00:22:36.220
we must get it as soon as possible.

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:37.120
Yes, sir.

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:40.200
Tahara, once we get the third treasure map,

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:42.000
we can quickly find the gold mine.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:44.530
Then you will have made a great contribution.

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:48.360
Kiriyama, send a telegram to our superiors immediately

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:49.420
to request backup.

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:50.200
Yes, sir.

00:22:55.760 --> 00:22:57.040
You, Baldy Zhang.

00:22:57.480 --> 00:22:59.680
You fooled me and kept me from sleeping.

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:02.280
Just you wait.

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:04.810
See if I don't teach you a lesson, you brat.

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:07.520
Who is it?

00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:12.320
Brother Banjin, you are not dead!

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:14.840
Good boy, you've become a patrol chief,

00:23:15.800 --> 00:23:17.330
and now you dare to curse me.

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:18.480
I wouldn't dare.

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:20.600
Aren't I perfectly alive?

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:23.360
Brother Banjin, even if I'm a patrol chief,

00:23:23.360 --> 00:23:25.420
it's not as good as when I was with you.

00:23:26.320 --> 00:23:28.050
Besides, how could I curse you?

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:30.040
Isn't it what they say in the stronghold?

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:31.770
Then pretend you didn't see me.

00:23:33.080 --> 00:23:33.920
Got it.

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:36.280
Let me ask you.

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:39.880
Did anything happen in the stronghold recently?

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:44.300
Things have been happening non-stop recently.

00:23:45.160 --> 00:23:46.280
Boss He's wife

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:48.400
was killed yesterday.

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:51.130
They haven't found the killer yet.

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:54.600
Boss He was even tied up.

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:56.000
I untied him myself.

00:23:58.160 --> 00:23:59.620
Boss He has given the word:

00:23:59.640 --> 00:24:00.560
keep the gates closed.

00:24:00.560 --> 00:24:01.960
Not even a fly can get out,

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:03.440
let alone outsiders.

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:05.720
They definitely can't get in.

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:07.800
I didn't rest all night yesterday.

00:24:08.280 --> 00:24:09.560
I just got off my shift.

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:11.400
Then where are you going now?

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:13.460
It's Baldy Zhang who guards the gate.

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:15.000
I've waited a long time

00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:16.530
and still haven't seen him.

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:18.370
I'm going to his house to check.

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:21.240
Normally he is very punctual,

00:24:21.280 --> 00:24:22.880
but I still haven't seen him.

00:24:23.200 --> 00:24:24.960
This is strange.

00:24:26.560 --> 00:24:29.640
- Let's go. I'll go with you.
- Okay.

00:24:39.560 --> 00:24:40.520
Lao Zhang.

00:24:47.000 --> 00:24:48.160
Nobody make a sound.

00:24:50.520 --> 00:24:51.560
Baldy Zhang.

00:24:55.560 --> 00:24:56.520
Lao Zhang.

00:24:58.960 --> 00:25:01.680
Lao Zhang, Lao Zhang.

00:25:01.760 --> 00:25:02.680
Baldy Zhang.

00:25:02.880 --> 00:25:04.480
Open the door! Open the door!

00:25:06.400 --> 00:25:08.120
Lao Zhang, tell him you caught a cold

00:25:08.120 --> 00:25:09.050
and can't go out.

00:25:09.080 --> 00:25:11.080
Tell him to go back. What's going on?

00:25:13.160 --> 00:25:13.920
Baldy Zhang.

00:25:14.120 --> 00:25:16.040
I caught a cold and can't go out.

00:25:18.240 --> 00:25:19.240
Where is your dad?

00:25:19.320 --> 00:25:20.640
Tell your dad to come out.

00:25:20.640 --> 00:25:22.240
Don't tell me your dad caught a cold too.

00:25:22.240 --> 00:25:23.640
My dad also caught a cold.

00:25:23.800 --> 00:25:24.920
We can't go out.

00:25:25.080 --> 00:25:26.200
You should leave now,

00:25:26.200 --> 00:25:27.530
or you'll get infected.

00:25:36.480 --> 00:25:37.680
It's really strange.

00:25:37.920 --> 00:25:40.120
Usually these two are as strong as an ox.

00:25:40.480 --> 00:25:42.140
Today they both caught a cold.

00:25:45.680 --> 00:25:47.280
Don't forget what I told you.

00:25:48.040 --> 00:25:49.920
Okay, let's go.

00:25:59.240 --> 00:26:00.200
I say, Baozi.

00:26:00.400 --> 00:26:02.000
What is it that you couldn't say in the cave

00:26:02.000 --> 00:26:03.660
and had to come out here to say?

00:26:04.800 --> 00:26:05.760
Boss Huo.

00:26:06.160 --> 00:26:08.820
This matter really has to be discussed out here.

00:26:10.520 --> 00:26:13.320
It can't be anything shameful, right?

00:26:15.840 --> 00:26:16.800
It's a secret.

00:26:17.400 --> 00:26:18.400
A secret?

00:26:23.600 --> 00:26:25.000
No one's around, tell me.

00:26:27.040 --> 00:26:29.040
When Chief Shangguan Bao was alive,

00:26:29.040 --> 00:26:30.520
he told me something.

00:26:32.080 --> 00:26:33.240
The old Chief

00:26:33.640 --> 00:26:35.800
discovered a gold mine.

00:26:36.640 --> 00:26:38.880
He drew a map and hid it in three parts.

00:26:39.480 --> 00:26:42.880
One part was given to Chief Shangguan Bao,

00:26:43.280 --> 00:26:45.960
one to the Chief of Zhenshanliang,

00:26:46.400 --> 00:26:49.160
and the last part is hidden with you.

00:26:49.800 --> 00:26:51.360
No, it's with me?

00:26:52.160 --> 00:26:53.560
Why didn't I know about it?

00:26:53.560 --> 00:26:55.920
Don't be anxious, let me finish.

00:26:56.120 --> 00:26:57.120
Go on.

00:26:57.600 --> 00:26:59.680
In order to protect the treasure, the old Chief

00:26:59.680 --> 00:27:02.440
carefully designed the hiding places.

00:27:02.800 --> 00:27:03.880
Not to mention you,

00:27:04.200 --> 00:27:06.440
even when the Chief of Zhenshanliang was alive,

00:27:06.440 --> 00:27:07.560
he didn't know.

00:27:08.360 --> 00:27:11.000
After he died, I retrieved that map

00:27:11.200 --> 00:27:13.130
and gave it to Chief Shangguan Bao.

00:27:14.600 --> 00:27:16.200
After the Chief passed away,

00:27:16.640 --> 00:27:19.680
both maps fell into He Xiaobian's hands.

00:27:19.840 --> 00:27:20.440
No.

00:27:20.880 --> 00:27:22.610
What I'm most worried about now

00:27:22.880 --> 00:27:24.600
is that the secret of the gold mine

00:27:24.600 --> 00:27:26.480
has also fallen into the hands of the Japanese.

00:27:26.480 --> 00:27:27.440
Do you mean

00:27:27.640 --> 00:27:30.200
you want me to help you find the third treasure map?

00:27:30.200 --> 00:27:31.760
I don't want you to help me find it.

00:27:31.760 --> 00:27:34.120
I want you to keep it safe once you find it.

00:27:34.240 --> 00:27:36.840
It must not fall into the hands of the Japanese.

00:27:37.800 --> 00:27:39.860
This is the wealth of our Sandaoyuan.

00:27:40.240 --> 00:27:42.370
We can never let outsiders plunder it.

00:27:43.160 --> 00:27:46.120
I always thought the old Chief

00:27:46.480 --> 00:27:48.120
favored Shangguan Bao.

00:27:49.400 --> 00:27:50.880
I never thought

00:27:51.560 --> 00:27:56.160
that the old Chief still cared about me.

00:27:58.240 --> 00:27:59.720
Old Chief,

00:28:01.000 --> 00:28:02.440
Huo Lang

00:28:04.080 --> 00:28:06.600
has always missed you.

00:28:08.160 --> 00:28:11.440
Chief Huo, don't be too sad.

00:28:16.120 --> 00:28:17.280
Think about it,

00:28:17.640 --> 00:28:19.280
when the old Chief was alive,

00:28:19.600 --> 00:28:21.600
did he leave anything for you?

00:28:24.920 --> 00:28:26.440
He didn't leave anything.

00:28:28.600 --> 00:28:29.360
Yes,

00:28:29.480 --> 00:28:31.920
he just gave me this scabbard.

00:28:32.200 --> 00:28:33.720
I matched the sword later.

00:28:40.480 --> 00:28:41.360
I've seen it.

00:28:41.560 --> 00:28:43.600
There's nothing inside the scabbard.

00:28:43.600 --> 00:28:45.760
The scabbard can be said to

00:28:45.960 --> 00:28:48.160
curb Huo Lang's hostility.

00:28:48.320 --> 00:28:49.320
It can also be said

00:28:49.480 --> 00:28:50.680
that when necessary,

00:28:50.720 --> 00:28:52.520
it curbs my dagger.

00:29:00.120 --> 00:29:02.600
The secret lies in this scabbard.

00:29:05.240 --> 00:29:06.480
Keep it safe.

00:29:07.160 --> 00:29:08.490
Without this third map,

00:29:08.760 --> 00:29:10.490
even if they have the first two,

00:29:10.640 --> 00:29:11.600
it's useless.

00:29:11.760 --> 00:29:14.000
Okay, I will definitely keep it safe.

00:30:54.800 --> 00:30:56.460
Hurry, take the hostage away.

00:30:58.160 --> 00:30:59.120
Yinger, go.

00:30:59.400 --> 00:31:00.200
Yinger,

00:31:00.400 --> 00:31:02.000
Uncle Liu is here to save you.

00:31:14.760 --> 00:31:15.800
Uncle, it's fine.

00:31:16.640 --> 00:31:17.400
Come here.

00:31:24.000 --> 00:31:24.800
Go.

00:32:01.360 --> 00:32:03.440
Keep an eye on them. I'll get some food.

00:32:03.440 --> 00:32:04.240
Yes, sir.

00:32:16.000 --> 00:32:16.760
Boss Huo.

00:32:17.120 --> 00:32:18.920
What is it?

00:32:19.400 --> 00:32:21.040
Boss, someone is outside the cave.

00:32:21.040 --> 00:32:21.840
Who?

00:32:22.720 --> 00:32:24.640
A big guy. Looks injured.

00:32:24.880 --> 00:32:26.400
And he's carrying a little girl.

00:32:26.400 --> 00:32:27.330
What's his name?

00:32:27.760 --> 00:32:29.820
Said he's from Qinglong Stronghold.

00:32:31.400 --> 00:32:32.320
Let's go.

00:32:33.880 --> 00:32:35.120
What are you doing?

00:32:39.200 --> 00:32:40.600
It's... It's Liu Banjin.

00:32:41.200 --> 00:32:42.040
Mr. Liu.

00:32:42.280 --> 00:32:43.760
Mr. Liu, it's you.

00:32:44.080 --> 00:32:45.160
What happened, Xiaoni?

00:32:45.160 --> 00:32:46.480
Xiaoni, come.

00:32:46.960 --> 00:32:48.200
How did you get hurt?

00:32:48.440 --> 00:32:50.680
It's nothing. Just a scratch.

00:32:51.120 --> 00:32:53.160
Quick, help him inside.

00:32:53.280 --> 00:32:53.600
Go.

00:32:53.640 --> 00:32:54.400
Come, Xiaoni.

00:32:54.400 --> 00:32:56.000
Let's treat the wound. Come.

00:32:57.280 --> 00:32:58.760
You are as strong as an ox.

00:32:58.880 --> 00:33:00.000
Who did this?

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.200
You got hurt.

00:33:01.600 --> 00:33:02.640
The Japs.

00:33:10.960 --> 00:33:12.000
It's right here.

00:33:12.280 --> 00:33:15.040
This is a new liaison point set up by the Tokumu Kikan.

00:33:15.040 --> 00:33:15.920
The shopkeeper is Chinese.

00:33:15.920 --> 00:33:17.320
He's also our informant.

00:33:18.800 --> 00:33:19.640
Good.

00:33:24.200 --> 00:33:25.080
Shopkeeper.

00:33:27.360 --> 00:33:29.000
Did you find the person I asked you to find?

00:33:29.000 --> 00:33:29.760
Yes, I did.

00:33:29.920 --> 00:33:31.240
The swordsman named Meng Shigui

00:33:31.240 --> 00:33:32.500
lives on Xixia Street.

00:33:32.560 --> 00:33:34.680
He often goes to a nearby tavern to drink.

00:33:34.680 --> 00:33:36.080
The tavern doesn't just sell liquor,

00:33:36.080 --> 00:33:37.080
it also sells mutton soup.

00:33:37.080 --> 00:33:38.880
It's called Yingsifang Tavern.

00:33:39.720 --> 00:33:40.560
Very good.

00:33:43.160 --> 00:33:44.480
Give us two sets of clothes.

00:33:44.480 --> 00:33:46.680
Okay, please follow me to the back hall.

00:33:50.320 --> 00:33:54.000
That's how I saved Nizi.

00:33:56.040 --> 00:33:58.160
This He Xiaobian actually colluded with the Japanese

00:33:58.160 --> 00:33:59.890
and killed our eldest brother.

00:34:00.280 --> 00:34:01.560
When he first came,

00:34:01.680 --> 00:34:04.000
I thought there was something wrong with him.

00:34:04.000 --> 00:34:06.840
He's usually as quiet as a mouse,

00:34:07.360 --> 00:34:09.320
and doesn't say a word.

00:34:09.600 --> 00:34:10.639
Now look,

00:34:10.840 --> 00:34:13.120
he suddenly dropped a bomb,

00:34:13.800 --> 00:34:16.199
and a Japanese one at that.

00:34:16.520 --> 00:34:18.980
Second Brother, can we stop talking for now?

00:34:19.199 --> 00:34:20.199
Say the word,

00:34:20.400 --> 00:34:22.120
and I'll take my brothers to Qinglong Stronghold right now

00:34:22.120 --> 00:34:23.719
to kill He Xiaobian. Let's go.

00:34:23.719 --> 00:34:24.600
Don't panic.

00:34:26.320 --> 00:34:28.719
Mr. Liu, where is Shangguan Ying?

00:34:30.440 --> 00:34:31.960
I failed to save her.

00:34:32.840 --> 00:34:34.770
She was taken away by the Japanese.

00:34:35.800 --> 00:34:36.639
Mr. Liu.

00:34:36.960 --> 00:34:38.440
Where was Ying taken?

00:34:39.480 --> 00:34:40.440
I don't know.

00:34:41.280 --> 00:34:42.800
I'm here this time

00:34:43.120 --> 00:34:46.199
to ask Boss Huo for help.

00:34:46.440 --> 00:34:48.770
We need to rescue Ying as soon as possible.

00:34:48.840 --> 00:34:50.440
You came to the right person.

00:34:50.520 --> 00:34:52.159
I will definitely save Ying'er.

00:34:52.159 --> 00:34:54.120
We'll attack Qinglong Stronghold tomorrow.

00:34:54.120 --> 00:34:55.679
Second Brother, I'll go prepare.

00:34:55.679 --> 00:34:56.639
Shitou, Zhuzi.

00:34:56.960 --> 00:34:58.620
Come back. What are you doing?

00:34:59.600 --> 00:35:01.330
Have you ever thought about it?

00:35:01.360 --> 00:35:02.880
The Japanese haven't attacked yet,

00:35:02.880 --> 00:35:04.400
and we're already fighting among ourselves.

00:35:04.400 --> 00:35:05.320
Do you think the Japanese

00:35:05.320 --> 00:35:07.250
are conquering too slowly or what?

00:35:07.760 --> 00:35:10.160
Also, when Chief Shangguan Bao was alive,

00:35:10.360 --> 00:35:12.760
he did his best to maintain unity among the strongholds.

00:35:12.760 --> 00:35:14.760
Now we're breaking it just like that.

00:35:14.760 --> 00:35:15.920
Our infighting

00:35:16.080 --> 00:35:17.680
will only benefit the Japanese.

00:35:17.680 --> 00:35:18.880
No, this won't work, that won't work.

00:35:18.880 --> 00:35:20.040
Then what will work?

00:35:22.080 --> 00:35:24.800
We can't attack by force, but we can outsmart them.

00:35:24.800 --> 00:35:25.880
Outsmart them?

00:35:27.880 --> 00:35:28.800
Master Liu,

00:35:29.200 --> 00:35:31.360
you have a plan, right?

00:35:31.920 --> 00:35:33.640
This kid is quite sneaky.

00:35:33.840 --> 00:35:37.400
It seems the secret I, Liu Banjin, kept for half my life

00:35:37.800 --> 00:35:40.320
is finally useful today.

00:35:41.640 --> 00:35:44.600
Boss, I'll tell you.

00:35:46.760 --> 00:35:51.360
Actually, there are multiple secret passages in our Qinglong Stronghold.

00:35:51.720 --> 00:35:53.250
Multiple secret passages?

00:35:56.600 --> 00:35:58.480
Then let's go in through the secret passages,

00:35:58.480 --> 00:35:59.920
find those Japanese devils,

00:35:59.920 --> 00:36:01.320
and save Shangguan Ying.

00:36:01.480 --> 00:36:02.360
Right.

00:36:03.560 --> 00:36:04.520
That's good.

00:36:28.480 --> 00:36:30.340
Wait, wait! You haven't paid yet.

00:36:30.440 --> 00:36:32.300
What money? Food money? What for?

00:36:32.320 --> 00:36:33.650
For the food and drinks!

00:36:34.080 --> 00:36:34.760
Sir,

00:36:34.760 --> 00:36:36.960
please don't make it hard on us workers.

00:36:37.000 --> 00:36:38.520
You haven't paid for your meals several times,

00:36:38.520 --> 00:36:40.120
and we had to cover it for you.

00:36:40.800 --> 00:36:42.720
You must pay us this time.

00:36:43.800 --> 00:36:45.800
Do you even know who I am?

00:36:46.280 --> 00:36:47.320
I'm Mr. Meng!

00:36:47.960 --> 00:36:49.600
Am I someone you can afford to mess with?

00:36:49.600 --> 00:36:50.920
Call your boss over. No,

00:36:50.920 --> 00:36:52.120
I'll beat him up too.

00:36:52.800 --> 00:36:54.920
What Uncle Meng?

00:36:55.080 --> 00:36:55.960
Beat him.

00:36:58.920 --> 00:37:00.920
Not paying! You ate without paying!

00:37:01.000 --> 00:37:04.040
I'll beat you to death! You ate without paying!

00:37:04.520 --> 00:37:05.520
Beat you to death!

00:37:06.080 --> 00:37:06.740
Stop, stop!

00:37:11.920 --> 00:37:13.960
Boss, what's going on?

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:15.320
He ate without paying.

00:37:15.520 --> 00:37:17.180
It's happened several times.

00:37:19.960 --> 00:37:21.720
Boss, is this enough?

00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:24.760
Is it enough?

00:37:25.120 --> 00:37:26.520
Enough, enough, enough.

00:37:28.000 --> 00:37:28.840
Go back.

00:37:59.200 --> 00:38:02.000
The current situation is getting more and more severe.

00:38:02.000 --> 00:38:04.860
The united front work has reached a deadlock again.

00:38:05.960 --> 00:38:07.690
I must quickly figure out a way.

00:38:08.200 --> 00:38:10.400
I can't just sit here and wait for death.

00:38:29.920 --> 00:38:31.450
Our missions keep failing,

00:38:33.240 --> 00:38:35.700
and the Japanese are becoming more rampant.

00:38:37.040 --> 00:38:38.770
Now the boss has been murdered,

00:38:40.560 --> 00:38:42.200
and Yinger was captured.

00:38:42.960 --> 00:38:44.220
Don't be so depressed.

00:38:44.640 --> 00:38:46.500
Who said all the missions failed?

00:38:46.560 --> 00:38:47.840
We got the vaccines,

00:38:48.240 --> 00:38:49.960
saved the civilians and the underground party,

00:38:49.960 --> 00:38:51.220
and blew up the armory.

00:38:51.360 --> 00:38:52.960
Aren't these all victories?

00:38:55.720 --> 00:38:56.980
When two armies fight,

00:38:57.720 --> 00:38:59.580
there are always wins and losses.

00:38:59.880 --> 00:39:02.610
The most important thing is that we can't give up.

00:39:06.720 --> 00:39:08.920
We are going to rescue Yinger tomorrow.

00:39:09.200 --> 00:39:10.800
How sure are you about this?

00:39:11.320 --> 00:39:12.980
I thought about it carefully.

00:39:13.040 --> 00:39:14.640
She was taken by Masao Tahara,

00:39:14.640 --> 00:39:16.160
only to be used as a hostage.

00:39:16.160 --> 00:39:18.490
So her life shouldn't be in danger for now.

00:39:18.720 --> 00:39:20.000
Right now, the most important thing

00:39:20.000 --> 00:39:21.560
is to control He Xiaobian.

00:39:22.080 --> 00:39:24.480
We can't let him collude with the Japanese,

00:39:24.480 --> 00:39:27.010
otherwise Qinglong Stronghold will be lost.

00:40:13.520 --> 00:40:16.380
We still need to think about saving Shangguan Ying.

00:40:17.440 --> 00:40:19.240
This niece of mine

00:40:19.560 --> 00:40:21.480
takes after her father, Second Brother.

00:40:21.480 --> 00:40:22.440
Second Brother.

00:40:23.280 --> 00:40:24.080
I don't know.

00:40:27.640 --> 00:40:28.570
Second Brother.

00:40:30.160 --> 00:40:31.090
Second Brother.

00:40:31.480 --> 00:40:33.340
Second Brother. Second Brother.

00:40:33.600 --> 00:40:34.440
Meng Shigui.

00:40:34.800 --> 00:40:36.560
Go, go, go. Go and have a look.

00:40:36.680 --> 00:40:37.600
Chief Huo.

00:40:38.080 --> 00:40:40.680
This person is not trustworthy. We must be on guard.

00:40:40.680 --> 00:40:41.480
Okay.

00:40:41.840 --> 00:40:42.640
Brother.

00:40:43.280 --> 00:40:44.040
Brother.

00:40:44.560 --> 00:40:47.160
Brother, I missed you so much.

00:40:47.280 --> 00:40:48.760
Wait, where did you come from?

00:40:48.760 --> 00:40:49.600
This...

00:40:50.640 --> 00:40:51.320
Brother.

00:40:51.520 --> 00:40:52.480
Meng Shigui.

00:40:52.680 --> 00:40:54.360
When we were fighting the Japanese

00:40:54.360 --> 00:40:55.360
in Luoyang City,

00:40:55.560 --> 00:40:56.520
where were you?

00:40:56.760 --> 00:40:58.800
Why didn't you think of Second Brother then?

00:40:58.800 --> 00:40:59.960
Second Brother, you ran away

00:40:59.960 --> 00:41:01.360
faster than anyone else.

00:41:01.560 --> 00:41:02.490
Second Brother,

00:41:02.640 --> 00:41:04.480
Wang Shi'er, I swear to God!

00:41:04.720 --> 00:41:06.120
If I didn't run, I would have been killed.

00:41:06.120 --> 00:41:07.980
Second Brother, look at my wound.

00:41:08.200 --> 00:41:09.120
I see it.

00:41:09.240 --> 00:41:10.360
Hurry up

00:41:10.480 --> 00:41:11.560
and take him back.

00:41:11.680 --> 00:41:13.000
It's just a small scratch, walk by yourself.

00:41:13.000 --> 00:41:13.930
He can't go back.

00:41:16.240 --> 00:41:16.960
Second Brother,

00:41:16.960 --> 00:41:17.640
why?

00:41:18.080 --> 00:41:18.920
Boss Huo,

00:41:19.280 --> 00:41:20.880
I have reliable information

00:41:21.000 --> 00:41:22.640
that Meng Shigui is a Japanese spy.

00:41:22.640 --> 00:41:23.560
Don't believe him.

00:41:23.560 --> 00:41:24.400
Second Brother.

00:41:24.400 --> 00:41:25.040
No,

00:41:25.280 --> 00:41:26.080
if he is a spy,

00:41:26.320 --> 00:41:28.360
we need proof, don't we?

00:41:28.640 --> 00:41:29.700
Where is the proof?

00:41:30.280 --> 00:41:31.880
A spy? Where is the evidence?

00:41:32.240 --> 00:41:33.160
Second Brother,

00:41:33.160 --> 00:41:35.560
don't listen to him sow discord between us.

00:41:35.560 --> 00:41:36.560
If anyone is a spy,

00:41:36.640 --> 00:41:38.200
he is, Second Brother.

00:41:38.360 --> 00:41:39.720
Second Brother, believe me.